  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II.</p><p>1-Bromopropane is reacted with reagents in List-I to give product in List-II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List-I Reagent</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List-II Product</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A.</td>\t\t\t<td>KOH (alc)</td>\t\t\t<td>I.</td>\t\t\t<td>Nitrile</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B.</td>\t\t\t<td>KCN (alc)</td>\t\t\t<td>II.</td>\t\t\t<td>Ester</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C.</td>\t\t\t<td>AgNO<sub>2</sub></td>\t\t\t<td>III.</td>\t\t\t<td>Alkene</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td>H<sub>3</sub>CCOOAg</td>\t\t\t<td>IV.</td>\t\t\t<td>Nitroalkane</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>Choose the correct answer from the options given below<p>&nbsp;</p>"
  },
